{'symbol': 'WAT', 'date': '2023-03-15 09:00:00', 'title': "WATERS CORPORATION LISTED AS NO. 5 ON BARRON'S 100 MOST SUSTAINABLE COMPANIES 2023 LIST", 'text': "MILFORD, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #ESG--WATERS CORPORATION'S (NYSE:WAT) COMPANYWIDE COMMITMENT TO “LEAVING THE WORLD BETTER THAN WE FOUND IT” HAS EARNED IT THE NUMBER FIVE RANKING ON THE BARRON'S 2023 100 MOST SUSTAINABLE COMPANIES U.S. LIST – ITS THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR ON THE LIST, AND ITS SECOND TIME AMONGST THE TOP TEN. WATERS HAS A STRONG FOCUS ON MAKING PROGRESS AGAINST A SET OF ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL, AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) GOALS."}